# Build artifacts
/build/

# Vendored deps — repopulated by `cyrius deps` from the
# version-pinned snapshot in cyrius.cyml [deps]. Keeping this
# out of the repo prevents stale stubs from a prior cyrius
# version sitting in tree (matches agnosys/patra/yukti convention).
/lib/

# Resolver lockfile — NOT a distribution contract. The dep pins in
# cyrius.cyml [deps.*] (git tags) are the source of truth; `cyrius
# deps` regenerates cyrius.lock locally. Under cyrius 6.0.x the lock
# records the full resolved set including the toolchain's stdlib,
# whose hashes track the exact installed snapshot — so a committed
# lock drifts between dev machines and CI. patra/sigil run `cyrius
# deps` in CI but never verify or ship the lock; libro matches.
/cyrius.lock

